PATH RESOLUTION NOTE (no silent drift)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated prompt's "Output" path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Charging/**` does
NOT match this repository. The real, build-compiled convention (project.yml compiles
`apps/apple/Sources/**`, and the sibling P7 charging page Powershare lives under it) is:

    apps/apple/Sources/Features/Charging/**

The page was implemented there so it actually compiles into the iOS + macOS app targets
(verified: all 7 TeslaChargingHistory*.swift appear as SwiftCompile units in BOTH the
macOS and iOS builds). `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Charging/` is NOT a compiled source
root in project.yml; placing the file there would produce dead, uncompiled code. This is
a faithful interpretation of the artifact's intent ("the Charging feature directory"),
not scope narrowing — and mirrors the predecessor Powershare P7 log's identical note.

