Data source (web hook parity — names kept at Swift call sites):
  useVehicles                     -> GET /vehicles                              (loadVehicles)
  useTeslaChargingHistory         -> GET /tesla/charging/history{?vin}          (loadHistory)
  useRefreshTeslaChargingHistory  -> POST /tesla/charging/history/refresh{?vin} (refreshHistory)
  getTeslaChargingInvoiceURL      -> /api/v1/tesla/charging/invoice/{id}        (model.invoiceURL, a pure path)
  All bound through TeslaChargingHistoryPageModel (no networking in the view, ADR-004).

SI discipline (ADR-005): usage energy is stored SI watt-hours; it converts to the user's
energy unit ONLY at the render boundary via the shared KMP `Units` facade (P1/S5,
TeslaChargingFormat.energy). Monetary fields (total_due / total_spend / avg_cost_per_kwh /
rate_base) are currency amounts the API materializes; nothing non-SI is stored or computed.

